@startuml Sfinity_Deployment_Diagram
!theme plain

title Sfinity — Deployment Diagram

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' NODES
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

node "<<Mobile Device>>\nAndroid / iOS" as Mobile {
  artifact "Flutter App\n(APK / IPA)" as FlutterApp
  artifact "Firebase SDK\n(Firebase Auth)" as FirebaseSDK
}

node "<<Web Browser>>" as Browser {
  artifact "React SPA\n(Vite Build)" as ReactApp
}

node "<<Server>>\nWeb Server" as WebServer {
  artifact "Nginx\n(reverse proxy)" as Nginx
}

node "<<Server>>\nApplication Server" as AppServer {
  artifact "Node.js / Express\n(TypeScript)" as ExpressApp
  artifact "JWT Middleware" as JWTMiddleware
  artifact "RBAC Middleware" as RBACMiddleware
  artifact "Prisma ORM" as Prisma
  artifact "Firebase Admin SDK" as FirebaseAdmin
  artifact "Swagger UI" as Swagger
  artifact "Nodemailer" as Mailer
  artifact "Multer\n(file upload)" as Uploader
}

node "<<Database>>" as Database {
  database "SQLite\n(Prisma migrations)" as SQLite
  folder "uploads/\n(images, files)" as Uploads
}

cloud "Firebase" {
  artifact "Firebase Auth\n(Google, Facebook)" as FirebaseAuth
  artifact "Cloud Messaging\n(push notifications)" as FCM
  artifact "Firestore\n(optional)" as Firestore
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' CONNECTIONS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Mobile --> Browser : HTTPS
Mobile --> FirebaseSDK : OAuth 2.0
FlutterApp ---> FirebaseSDK
FlutterApp -up-> ExpressApp : HTTP/REST
ReactApp -up-> ExpressApp : HTTP/REST

Browser -up-> Nginx : HTTPS (prod)
WebServer -up-> Nginx : reverse proxy

Nginx --> ExpressApp : localhost:3000

ExpressApp --> Prisma
ExpressApp --> FirebaseAdmin
ExpressApp --> Mailer
ExpressApp --> Uploader
ExpressApp --> JWTMiddleware
ExpressApp --> RBACMiddleware

Prisma --> SQLite
Uploader --> Uploads

FirebaseAdmin --> FirebaseAuth
FirebaseAdmin --> FCM

ExpressApp --> FirebaseAuth : verify token
ExpressApp --> FCM : send push

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' DEPLOYMENT NOTES
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

note bottom of Mobile
  **Flutter run targets:**
  - Android emulator: 10.0.2.2:3000
  - iOS simulator: localhost:3000
  - Physical device (LAN): <machine-ip>:3000
  - Chrome web: flutter run -d chrome
end note

note bottom of AppServer
  **API Base URL:**
  - Dev: http://localhost:3000/api
  - Prod: https://api.sfinity.com/api
end note

note bottom of Database
  **Prisma Schema:**
  - migrations/ folder
  - prisma/dev.db (SQLite)
  - prisma/seed.ts
end note

note right of FirebaseAuth
  **Auth providers:**
  - Email/Password (local)
  - Google (OAuth)
  - Facebook (OAuth)
end note

@enduml
